[test/cli/wrap_ansi_line_perf_test.dart#5889]
95:/// Deterministic stand-in for a contended runner: delegates to a real
96:/// stopwatch but adds [spikeMs] of fake preemption time to the timed
97:/// measurements whose 1-based index is in [spiked] — a runner steal
98:/// spanning several timed runs, the shape that flaked gh-1532 live.
99:///
100:/// [calls] exposes how many measurements the fake has timed. The
101:/// preemption test asserts the expected total (attempts × sizes ×
102:/// runs) so a future change to the measure loop's call layout turns
103:/// the index-based [spiked] addressing into a LOUD failure instead of
104:/// silently shifting the spikes onto the wrong measurements (where
105:/// they could depress the ratio and leave the test green while
106:/// asserting nothing).
107:final class ContendedClock {
108:  ContendedClock({required this._spiked, this.spikeMs = 30});
109:
110:  final Set<int> _spiked;
111:
112:  /// Fake preemption time added to each spiked measurement.
113:  final double spikeMs;
114:
115:  /// Number of measurements timed so far (1-based [spiked] addressing).
116:  var calls = 0;
117:
118:  /// Times [body] like [ElapsedUs], adding the spike when spiked.
119:  int call(void Function() body) {
120:    final sw = Stopwatch()..start();
121:    body();
122:    sw.stop();
123:    calls++;
124:    return sw.elapsedMicroseconds +
125:        (_spiked.contains(calls) ? (spikeMs * 1000).round() : 0);
126:  }
127:}
128:
129:/// Scripted elapsed clock: returns a FIXED [slowUs] for the 1-based
130:/// measurement-call indices in [slowed] and a fixed [cleanUs] otherwise
131:/// (one call per timed run; the JIT warm-up inside [medianWrapMs] is
132:/// untimed and never reaches the clock). Unlike [ContendedClock] nothing
133:/// is stopwatch-measured, so a contention shape asserted against it is
134:/// deterministic on any machine — the gh-1460 fixed-arrays style.
135:final class ScriptedClock {
136:  ScriptedClock({
137:    required this.slowed,
138:    this.slowUs = 119000,
139:    this.cleanUs = 17000,
140:  });
